WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.791 --> 00:00:05.375
It's so hot.

00:00:05.458 --> 00:00:08.625
Did we wander
into the Amazon jungle or something?

00:00:08.666 --> 00:00:10.458
Don't make me laugh.

00:00:10.541 --> 00:00:13.833
Compared to the hell
of 122-degree heat during the race,

00:00:13.958 --> 00:00:15.958
this jungle is a fake.

00:00:16.541 --> 00:00:17.625
That's right.

00:00:17.666 --> 00:00:20.166
This shouldn't exist in this world.

00:00:20.791 --> 00:00:22.375
We must destroy it.

00:00:24.958 --> 00:00:25.791
Could they be…

00:00:26.291 --> 00:00:28.375
Uranus Crystal Power!

00:00:28.875 --> 00:00:31.000
Neptune Crystal Power!

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.791
Pluto Crystal Power!

00:00:34.666 --> 00:00:36.375
Saturn Crystal Power!

00:00:36.958 --> 00:00:38.375
Make Up!

00:01:31.208 --> 00:01:32.416
The protector

00:01:33.125 --> 00:01:35.208
of the Planet of the Sky, Uranus,

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:36.375
Guardian of Flight!

00:01:37.208 --> 00:01:38.583
Sailor Uranus!

00:01:40.875 --> 00:01:46.041
The protector of the Planet of the Deep
Sea, Neptune, Guardian of Embrace!

00:01:46.708 --> 00:01:48.541
Sailor Neptune!

00:01:49.625 --> 00:01:55.208
Protector of the Planet of Space-Time,
Pluto, Guardian of Revolution!

00:01:55.291 --> 00:01:56.500
Sailor Pluto!

00:01:57.625 --> 00:02:03.041
Protector of the Planet of Silence,
Saturn, Guardian of Ruin and Birth!

00:02:03.916 --> 00:02:05.041
Sailor Saturn!

00:02:07.541 --> 00:02:08.666
We have arrived!

